Overview

This project compares tokenization techniques used in Large Language Models (LLMs). It demonstrates how text is converted into tokens and how different tokenization approaches affect token counts.

Objectives

Understand the concept of tokenization.

Explore how text is divided into tokens.

Compare tokenization results.

Understand the relationship between text, tokens, and LLM processing.

