Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/laxmispandana-wq/GEN-AI_2520030160.git

Navigate to the Week-4 folder:

cd GEN-AI_2520030160/LAB/Week-4

Install the required dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Execution

Run the Python program:

python tokenizer_comparison.py

Working

The program demonstrates tokenization and compares how text is processed into tokens. It helps understand how tokenization plays an important role in preparing input for Large Language Models.

